{"id":8988968,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/9655","number":9655,"state":"merged","title":"fix(flash_attn/fia): CalcBlockNeedRowInvalid跨G block无效行漏判 同步到9.2.0-beta.1","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9655","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9655/issues","body":"## 修改内容\n\nGS1 layout跨多个G时, 原代码仅检查首尾G的s1边界, 遗漏中间完整G的无效行。当block跨G且s1StartTdx>=s1FirstValidToken时返回false, 跳过RowInvalid, 导致全mask行output未清零。\n\n改为判断是否存在无效行: s1FirstValidToken>0 覆盖左无效行, s1LastValidToken<actS1Size-1 覆盖右无效行。RowInvalidUpdateVF内部逐行检查max==minValue, 不会误清有效行。\n\n涉及文件:\n- flash_attn_block_vec_noquant_gqa_nd.h — 跨G判断逻辑修复\n- fia_block_vec_noquant_gqa.h — 加 static_cast<int64_t> 防下溢\n\n同步 master PR #4027 修复到 9.2.0-beta.1 分支。\n\n## 测试\n- [x] OAT 合规检查通过\n- [x] 精度验证通过(master 分支已验证)","assignees_number":26,"assignees":[{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c115ac4dcd85262391d21a","login":"wenxin_fight","name":"wenxin_fight","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c2315759d71b2d89a80e41","login":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","name":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6877715d70f8532fca319fe9","login":"liudan12","name":"liudan12","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liudan12","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c79924adff5452d7b9b8","login":"yang-binrong","name":"yang-binrong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yang-binrong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c187053cff786c91063e","login":"xuanyuand